# Oko, Thief of Crowns' -5 exchanges control of two targets; if one of them is illegal on resolution the exchange cannot be
# done and none of it happens (CR 701.12). Bot1 targets its Mox Sapphire and Bot2's Llanowar Elves, then Lightning Bolts
# the Elves in response: the Mox stays Bot1's. Oko, whose loyalty cost was paid, is on 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Oko, Thief of Crowns
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Forest x3
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x15

